# The patch series on the pinned llama.cpp commit of scripts/lib.sh, grouped by
# subsystem. scripts/apply-patches.sh applies the series in this order, and
# scripts/check-patches.sh reconstructs it and compares the result with the
# submodule file by file. A patch can change the files of an earlier patch, thus
# the order is part of the series and a reader must take it from the top.
#
# scripts/regen-patch.sh rebuilds one patch from the live submodule. It gives a
# correct result only for the last patch that touches the files of that patch.

